{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "118", "x": 0.8993818052860431, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03436144331759268, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with dyslexia?", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.15006260942616476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Children often lack motivation to learn that way.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.4935753634791556, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Children become fluent relatively quickly.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.4286691220367853, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Children react more positively if they make a mistake.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.5494108634210753, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "26 When discussing whether to teach cursive or print writing, the woman thinks", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.8262332496012036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "that", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3030039694975767, "w": 0.047008793462762884, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cursive writing disadvantages a certain group of children.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.5869537073177084, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "print writing is associated with lower academic performance.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.6220272889644293, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "most teachers in the UK prefer a traditional approach to handwriting.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.7034625009342587, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "27 According to the students, what impact does poor handwriting have on exam", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4544453076775557, "w": 0.8261898815457441, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "performance?", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.14804689194064666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There is evidence to suggest grades are affected by poor handwriting.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.7167662414649257, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Neat handwriting is less important now than it used to be.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.5938071929046991, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Candidates write more slowly and produce shorter answers.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.6121502399647806, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "28 What prediction does the man make about the future of handwriting?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6343901559839935, "w": 0.753855553412784, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6627576239083618, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Touch typing will be taught before writing by hand.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6627576239083618, "w": 0.5224002029789035, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6909396534671467, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Children will continue to learn to write by hand.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6909396534671467, "w": 0.48369831447950695, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7192700035412843, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "People will dislike handwriting on digital devices.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7192700035412843, "w": 0.5026461049796063, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "29 The woman is concerned that relying on digital devices has made it difficult", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7858686308748994, "w": 0.8261029403849176, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "for her to", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8141990563918221, "w": 0.0998207428076438, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8425294064659596, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "take detailed notes.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8425294064659596, "w": 0.2063012887489218, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8708845017735845, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "spell and punctuate.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8708845017735845, "w": 0.2123484412054761, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8992148518477221, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "read old documents.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8992148518477221, "w": 0.21214687714629582, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}